    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0&quot;Binarycurse&quot; is a suspenseful puzzle adventure game filled with moral dilemmas. Players take on the role of a protagonist who accidentally discovers a mysterious old computer, embarking on a journey to uncover shocking truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316170/extras/ce90c315a065f1ea54d18c8754656c07.avif?t=1732241326\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, complete the first challenge by using the lock screen interface prompt to unlock the lock screen password</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the interface, operate by clicking with the mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden information or password</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the locked folder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the plot development through decrypted files</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316170/extras/111b877ecc4b01f606f01b4d6c19b48f.avif?t=1732241326\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0&quot;Binarycurse&quot; is a suspenseful puzzle adventure game filled with moral dilemmas. Players take on the role of a protagonist who accidentally discovers a mysterious old computer, embarking on a journey to uncover shocking truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316170/extras/ce90c315a065f1ea54d18c8754656c07.avif?t=1732241326\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, complete the first challenge by using the lock screen interface prompt to unlock the lock screen password</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the interface, operate by clicking with the mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden information or password</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the locked folder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the plot development through decrypted files</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316170/extras/111b877ecc4b01f606f01b4d6c19b48f.avif?t=1732241326\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span></p></li></ul>",
